            The <strong class="text-white">Ridgid HD1400</strong> is the Ridgid shop vac to buy for most garages and workshops: a 14 gallon drum, a clog-resistant 2-1/2 inch hose and the VF5000 fine dust filter in the box. The <strong class="text-white">HD1200</strong> does nearly the same job for less, and the <strong class="text-white">HD1800</strong> earns its cart only if you move water or heavy debris often.
          </p>
